Modifications: ten upstream skills merged into one SKILL.md (author-component
rules plus a render-mode table and routing) and nine references, each cut to
150 lines or fewer; plan-ui-change and the author-component references folded
into references/components.md. Upstream "read AGENTS.md" steps replaced with
detecting the render mode from Program.cs and App.razor; the per-mode
AGENTS.md templates (create-blazor-project/assets/agents-md) and
use-igniteui-blazor were not ported; cross-links renamed to adminhead plugins.
Corrections, checked against the ASP.NET Core docs (Context7
/dotnet/aspnetcore.docs) on 2026-10-17: [PersistentState] requires a public
property (upstream showed a private field); InputFile's default
OpenReadStream limit is 500 KB and GetMultipleFiles takes maximumFileCount;
Blazor Server components use IDbContextFactory rather than a circuit-scoped
DbContext; the scoped-state example no longer discards InvokeAsync tasks;
.NET 9/10 version requirements marked on RendererInfo,
ExcludeFromInteractiveRouting, auth state serialization and PersistentState.
Added notes on persisted-state size and secrecy, untrusted upload metadata,
server-side enforcement of API authorization, and [JSInvokable] input
validation.
